    "Speech is transcribed on your iPhone and the audio is discarded immediately. The live transcript is forgotten when the session ends.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tal skrivs ut på din iPhone och ljudet slängs direkt. Den löpande utskriften glöms när sessionen slutar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Speech is transcribed on your iPhone and the audio is discarded immediately. Transcripts stay on the phone.": {
