          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cannot be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Det går inte att ångra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Title (optional)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rubrik (valfri)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To answer a question, the transcribed text (never audio) is sent to Lumen's server, which asks Claude by Anthropic. Without a connection there are no answers.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "För att svara på en fråga skickas den transkriberade texten (aldrig ljud) till Lumens server, som frågar Claude från Anthropic. Utan uppkoppling ges inga svar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcribing on this iPhone · %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transkriberar på den här telefonen · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type a question": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skriv en fråga"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the goals in answers": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Använd målen i svaren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Röst"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Withdraw consent": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta tillbaka samtycke"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Withdraw consent?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta tillbaka samtycket?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You are responsible for informing anyone whose speech is transcribed. Do not use Lumen where recording is not allowed, for example during exams.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du ansvarar för att informera alla vars tal transkriberas. Använd inte Lumen där inspelning inte är tillåten, till exempel under prov."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can also say \"kom ihåg …\". Lumen never saves anything you did not ask it to remember. Saved on this iPhone and sent with your questions. Memories expire 2 years after you last confirmed them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du kan också säga ”kom ihåg …”. Lumen sparar aldrig något du inte bett om. Sparas på den här iPhonen och skickas med dina frågor. Minnen försvinner 2 år efter att du senast bekräftade dem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can stop at any time": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du kan sluta när du vill"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You start and stop listening yourself. While the microphone is live, a red indicator is shown in the app and iOS shows its own microphone indicator.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du startar och stoppar lyssningen själv. När mikrofonen är på visas en röd indikator i appen, och iOS visar sin egen mikrofonindikator."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your music can play now. Answers are shown, not spoken, until you resume.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nu kan din musik spelas. Svar visas men läses inte upp förrän du fortsätter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own questions and Lumen's answers are saved word for word with a short summary, and memories only when you ask for it. Other people's speech is not saved. Delete it in Settings at any time; it is deleted automatically after 2 years.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dina egna frågor och Lumens svar sparas ordagrant med en kort sammanfattning, och minnen bara när du ber om det. Andra personers tal sparas inte. Radera när du vill i Inställningar; det raderas automatiskt efter 2 år."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
